span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Default constructor. <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/value_initialization\">Value-initializes</a> the underlying view <code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/lazy_split_view#base\">base_</a></i></code> and the delimiter <code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/lazy_split_view#pattern\">pattern_</a></i></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Initializes the underlying view <code><i>base_</i></code> with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and the delimiter <code><i>pattern_</i></code> with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>pattern<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Initializes the underlying view <code><i>base_</i></code> with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/all_view\"><span class=\"kw2935\">views::<span class=\"me2\">all</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>r<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> and the delimiter <code><i>pattern_</i></code> with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/single_view\"><span class=\"kw3122\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">single_view</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">{</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>e<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> base\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the underlying view to be split\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> pattern\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a view to be used as the delimiter\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> e\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> an element to be used as the delimiter\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue3714\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 3714</a><br>(<a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wg21.link/P2711R1\" data-external=\"1\">P2711R1</a>)\n</td>\n<td>C++20\n</td>\n<td>the multi-parameter constructor <span class=\"t-v\">(<a href=\"#Version_2\">2</a>)</span> was not explicit\n</td>\n<td>made explicit\n</td></tr></table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/lazy_split_view","title":"std::ranges::views::lazy_split, std::ranges::lazy_split_view"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::lazy_split_view<V,Pattern>::lazy_split_view","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Constructs a lazy_split_view."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"base, pattern, e"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"Defect reports","note":"The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards."}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":156,"codeBlockCount":